*.pyc

# Generatsiya natijasi — `assets-3d/export` dan avtomatik ko`chiriladi.
# Manba bitta: `assets-3d/export`. Nusxalarni commit qilish har model
# o`zgarishida ~8 MB binar diff beradi va tarixni bekorga shishiradi.
#   sayt:  apps/web/scripts/sync-models.mjs      (predev / prebuild)
#   mobil: apps/mobile/scripts/sync-models.mjs   (prestart / preios)
apps/web/public/models/
apps/mobile/assets/models/
